<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 510 0 R/Alt(Six panels, site percolation on the left and bond on the right, for sizes from 2 to the 10 to 2 to the 16. Top: distance of the plateau from the threshold against the target, on one curve at large targets and leveling off at small targets at a level that decreases with size. Middle: the same distance times L to the 3/4 against u, collapsing at large u on a dashed line. Bottom: fraction of runs that survive against u, close to one except at small u and small sizes.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 1305 0 R>>
